== a parameter expectation is checked at each application
counts: checks 1 deps 1 equalities 1 omissions 0
check argument A : S
dep <S> -alias-> S
equal F(A) = FA
== parameter members are checked against the argument's members
counts: checks 1 deps 8 equalities 1 omissions 0
check argument A : Members@F(A)
dep Members -definition-> <#1>
dep Members@F(A) -instance-> Members
dep Members@F(A) -argument-member-> A.T@A
dep Members@F(A) -instance-> <Members>
dep A.T@A -alias-> S
dep Members.T@body(Members) -alias-> S
dep <#1> -interface-> Members.T@body(Members)
dep <Members> -alias-> Members
equal F(A) = FA
== an inlined application anchors at a site
counts: checks 3 deps 6 equalities 0 omissions 0
check ascription <location> : S
check ascription M : S.T@site(Site.ml#0)
check argument <location> : param(F.X)@site(Site.ml#1)
dep S.T -include-> S.T@site(Site.ml#0)
dep S -definition-> <#1>
dep S.T@site(Site.ml#0) -instance-> S.T@body(S)
dep param(F.X)@site(Site.ml#1) -instance-> <param(F.X)>
dep <#1> -interface-> S.T@body(S)
dep <M> -interface-> S.T@site(Site.ml#0)
